6. coding_rules.md

Example:

Never manipulate DOM directly if helper exists.

Use Utils.createElement().

All API calls go through request.js.

CSS variables only.

Never hardcode colors.

Use event delegation.

Do not duplicate utilities.

Shared styles go into common.css.

This file prevents inconsistent implementations.


